1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,900
China's slowest big city? Chengdu.
中国最慢的大城：成都

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,300
Its famous alleys began as a 1718 army camp.
名巷1718年本是军营

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
Qing banner troops were garrisoned here.
清朝八旗兵驻扎于此

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
Now it's teahouses and slow afternoons.
如今满是茶馆与慢时光

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,300
Chengdu keeps over 10,000 of them.
成都有上万家茶馆

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,600
Double-tap if you'd sit here all day.
想坐一下午的点个赞

8
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,000
The gaiwan lidded tea set was invented here.
盖碗茶就发明在成都

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,400
Locals call this life bashi — just right.
四川话叫"巴适"

10
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,900
★ Expert Tip: skip midday, try Heming Teahouse.
避开正午，去鹤鸣茶社

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,300
Tea first, or mahjong first? Comment.
你先喝茶还是先打麻将？评论区见
